### 1. Buat Buku A (harus 201)
POST http://localhost:3000/books
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Buku A","author":"Budi","isbn":"1234567890","stock":10}

### 2. Buat Buku B (harus 201)
POST http://localhost:3000/books
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Buku B","author":"Sari","isbn":"0987654321","stock":5}

### 3. Validasi gagal (harus 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/books
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"","author":"X","isbn":"123","stock":-1}

### 4. Tidak ditemukan (harus 404)
GET http://localhost:3000/books/999

### 5. ISBN duplikat (harus 409)
POST http://localhost:3000/books
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Buku A","author":"Budi","isbn":"1234567890","stock":10}

### 6. Transfer sukses (harus 201, stok 7 dan 8)
POST http://localhost:3000/books/transfer
Content-Type: application/json

{"fromId":1,"toId":2,"qty":3}

### 7. Transfer gagal (harus 400, stok tidak berubah)
POST http://localhost:3000/books/transfer
Content-Type: application/json

{"fromId":1,"toId":2,"qty":999}

### 8. Cek stok setelah transfer gagal
GET http://localhost:3000/books